{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39756","headline":"奉酬翁文尧员外神泉之游见寄嘉什 · 黄滔","name":"奉酬翁文尧员外神泉之游见寄嘉什","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"含鸡假豸喜同游，野外嘶风并紫骝。\n松竹回寻青障寺，姓名题向白云楼。\n泉源出石清消暑，僧语离经妙破愁。\n争奈爱山尤恋阙，古来能有几人休。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄滔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39756.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39756","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}